<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Steel.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Steel.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial</p>
<p>Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Friday it has issued 20 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on shares of China Steel Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$26.7563   PREMIUM	    17.45 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$4.669     GEARING	    5.73X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	13.MAR.98    PAYDATE	    02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG   LISTING DATE     TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE NT$26.7563   MIN EXER LOT     5,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
